<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Prime Hospitality started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Prime Hospitality started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said Monday it had started coverage of Prime Hospitality Corp with a rating of intermediate- and long-term accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the hotel chain opened unchanged Monday at 20-5/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
